      "realName": null,
      "profile": "British indie rock band from London, founded in 2021.\r\n\r\nFormed as \"The Dinner Party\" in London whilst studying at University\r\nGained cult popularity during a year (2021 - 2022) of playing London's independent gig venues, attracting Management and PR deals and a recording deal with Island Records\r\nBegan recording at [l=The Church, London] Studios in Crouch Hill, with [a=James Ford]\r\nEarly in 2023, announced a change of name to \"The Last Dinner Party\", to avoid confusion with Terrace Martin, Kamasi Washington, Robert Glasper and 9th Wonder's [a=Dinner Party (2)] project.\r\n\r\nAbigail Morris - Vocals\r\nEmily Roberts - Lead guitar / Flute\r\nLizzie Mayland - Guitar\r\nGeorgia Davies - Bass\r\nAurora Nishevci - Keyboards / Piano / Keytar\r\n\r\nWith no permanent drummer, [a=Casper Miles], Isis Dunthorne and [a=Rebekah Rayner] have been among their live drummers.",
